00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.107
- Gin, yeah.
- Yes, we gave them your gin.

00:02:40.107 --> 00:02:41.370
No, I love that you wrote a book

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.650
and you get to like go all
over New Zealand, right,

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.180
