an elf, it was a dwarf.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.423
I got to play Groin, Groin the dwarf.

00:04:23.423 --> 00:04:24.777
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:04:24.777 --> 00:04:26.700
