the height of summer.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:52.770
- Yeah.
- Talk about climate change.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.427
Thankfully, there's still glaciers there.

00:06:54.427 --> 00:06:57.030
- Yeah.
- And I was in a kilt,

00:06:57.030 --> 00:07:00.488
riding in a helicopter with a
kilt on can be a bit drafty.

00:07:00.488 --> 00:07:01.783
- Oh.
- I have to admit.

00:07:01.783 --> 00:07:02.787
(audience laughing)

00:07:02.787 --> 00:07:05.070
But I was standing on
a glacier in commando,

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.995
so I feel like it's a first, right.

00:07:06.995 --> 00:07:10.530
- Commando! And I like how
you say glacier, I like that.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.390
- Glacier.
- I have actually stood on it.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.800
It was Portage Glacier in Alaska

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.590
and it is actually sad
because now I look back

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:18.780
