whenever I was there,

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.865
it's even gone down like
since I was there as well.

00:07:20.865 --> 00:07:21.698
- That is sad.
- But it is.

00:07:21.698 --> 00:07:23.310
I was terrified, I took
a helicopter up to it

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.960
