00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.920
But the whole time I was
just staring at the captain,

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.000
'cause he kept looking down,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.130
I'm like, "What's he looking
at? Is something broken?"

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:38.963
- [Kelly] Oh no.

00:07:38.963 --> 00:07:40.200
- I was pretty freaked out, yeah.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.730
- And if it is, I hope it's
not the thing at the top

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.930
